285
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:09,010
revive you as a raised ghost,

286
00:17:09,170 --> 00:17:11,030
and turn you into my servant.

287
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:44,890
So that...

288
00:17:45,770 --> 00:17:47,090
was your sacred art?

289
00:17:47,090 --> 00:17:49,030
The profane arts you cling to

290
00:17:49,710 --> 00:17:51,480
shall one day become a sword

291
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:52,890
that beheads you.

292
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,550
Zai...

293
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:57,720
Out of consideration for
Venerable Mother's nunhood,

294
00:17:58,690 --> 00:18:00,720
I shall warn you one last time.

295
00:18:01,430 --> 00:18:02,530
Cease this

296
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:04,880
before it becomes unsalvageable.

297
00:18:19,350 --> 00:18:20,610
Tormenting, huh?

298
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:24,970
Keep your mouth shut.

299
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,980
Bridle me not.

300
00:18:31,370 --> 00:18:33,280
Did Father not utter that

301
00:18:35,270 --> 00:18:37,000
once your path crossed
with that of your karmic soulmate,

302
00:18:38,130 --> 00:18:40,270
your sacred arts shall be strengthened?

303
00:18:46,210 --> 00:18:47,240
But how come...

304
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:51,980
you are defeated
by the arts you condemned as low?

305
00:18:56,370 --> 00:18:57,770
Let go of Master Bulan.

306
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:08,440
I am disciplining my younger sister.

307
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:09,980
Do not fucking meddle!

308
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:17,370
It is between family.

309
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:20,880
Thus, it is no skin off
a police officer's back.

310
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:26,440
Oh, it is.

311
00:19:27,110 --> 00:19:30,370
Because Master Bulan is my family.

312
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:32,490
If you don't want a consecrated bullet

313
00:19:32,490 --> 00:19:34,610
right in your fucking head, let her go!

314
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:35,980
What are you doing...

315
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:37,600
What on earth are you doing?!

316
00:19:39,980 --> 00:19:40,800
Very well...

317
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:43,160
Then,

318
00:19:43,980 --> 00:19:45,170
let us see

319
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:47,410
whether blood

320
00:19:48,610 --> 00:19:50,600
is thicker than water.

321
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,520
Come here.

322
00:20:00,710 --> 00:20:01,670
Om...

323
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:13,670
Peem...

324
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:28,280
I'm already dead
and a ghost because of you,

325
00:20:28,770 --> 00:20:31,980
and you're still shooting me dead again
with a consecrated bullet?

326
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:45,510
My little sister would never,
ever say something like that.

327
00:21:02,710 --> 00:21:05,030
Have you no consecrated bullets left?

328
00:21:11,290 --> 00:21:12,770
Please don't kill each other...

329
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:49,250
Treasure your hearts well,

330
00:21:51,590 --> 00:21:52,810
for when the time comes,

331
00:21:54,570 --> 00:21:56,990
I shall reap them from both your chests.

332
00:22:43,710 --> 00:22:46,290
The term "karmic soulmate,"

333
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:48,760
what does it mean?

334
00:22:49,360 --> 00:22:50,610
Your existence

335
00:22:50,990 --> 00:22:54,990
makes Master a woman
of boundless might and virtue.

336
00:22:55,590 --> 00:22:57,980
But on the other hand,

337
00:22:59,130 --> 00:23:01,190
Master's weakness...

338
00:23:01,630 --> 00:23:03,370
has started to take shape.

339
00:23:14,590 --> 00:23:15,450
My beloved...

340
00:23:15,810 --> 00:23:16,520
My beloved.

341
00:23:17,320 --> 00:23:18,350
Don't get up just yet.

342
00:23:19,650 --> 00:23:20,630
Get some rest.

343
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,170
Take it easy.

344
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:40,990
How did you come to my rescue, my dearest?

345
00:23:44,760 --> 00:23:46,680
Thong came to get me to help you.

346
00:23:48,430 --> 00:23:49,270
My beloved...

347
00:23:52,510 --> 00:23:53,980
I'm sorry

348
00:23:55,980 --> 00:23:57,760
that I took too long to help you.

349
00:24:00,810 --> 00:24:03,190
That's why you're hurt like this.

350
00:24:09,270 --> 00:24:10,400
It matters not.

351
00:24:11,350 --> 00:24:12,990
Your beloved is now safe and sound.

352
00:24:14,210 --> 00:24:15,770
Do not blame yourself, my dearest.

353
00:24:21,790 --> 00:24:22,590
So...

354
00:24:23,310 --> 00:24:25,360
who was the guy that hurt you?

355
00:24:27,390 --> 00:24:28,530
Can you tell me?

356
00:24:38,690 --> 00:24:40,200
My elder brother,

357
00:24:41,290 --> 00:24:42,280
Zai.

358
00:24:49,590 --> 00:24:51,550
Know you of my elder brother?

359
00:24:56,190 --> 00:24:58,530
Well, if he's the same guy I know,

360
00:24:59,760 --> 00:25:02,590
then he's behind
the whole thing with Krating.

361
00:25:06,590 --> 00:25:07,470
My beloved...

362
00:25:11,790 --> 00:25:14,310
would you tell me

363
00:25:15,170 --> 00:25:17,550
the story about your older brother?

364
00:25:20,970 --> 00:25:23,010
If it is of use to you,

365
00:25:24,770 --> 00:25:26,440
I shall, my beloved.

366
00:25:29,810 --> 00:25:32,670
My elder brother and I
entered the world seven years apart;

367
00:25:34,130 --> 00:25:35,670
thus, we were never very close.

368
00:25:37,030 --> 00:25:38,670
My elder brother

369
00:25:39,770 --> 00:25:41,980
yearned to learn
the sacred arts from Father

370
00:25:42,870 --> 00:25:44,840
and to inherit the family's legacy.

371
00:25:49,830 --> 00:25:51,040
Father did not choose him.

372
00:25:53,470 --> 00:25:54,670
But he chose you.

373
00:25:57,980 --> 00:26:00,870
No parents wish
to see their children quarrel.

374
00:26:02,490 --> 00:26:04,830
It was the sacred masters' decision.

375
00:26:07,670 --> 00:26:09,720
With different passions,

376
00:26:10,530 --> 00:26:11,980
my brother and I...

377
00:26:12,810 --> 00:26:14,550
walked different paths.

378
00:26:32,790 --> 00:26:33,610
Mother...

379
00:26:33,610 --> 00:26:34,320
what is happening?

380
00:26:34,560 --> 00:26:35,400
- Mother...
- Whoa...

381
00:26:40,490 --> 00:26:41,690
Mother... Mother!

382
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:43,350
Mother...

383
00:26:43,350 --> 00:26:44,390
Mother, what is going on?

384
00:26:45,280 --> 00:26:45,870
Father!

385
00:26:45,870 --> 00:26:46,810
Help Mother, please!

386
00:26:48,590 --> 00:26:49,490
- Mother... Mother!
- Chan.

387
00:26:49,490 --> 00:26:50,290
Chan!

388
00:27:02,190 --> 00:27:03,980
What is the family's tiger?

389
00:27:06,870 --> 00:27:09,980
It was our ancestor
who practiced magic to such an extent

390
00:27:10,570 --> 00:27:13,250
that it eventually rebounded upon them.

391
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:16,320
Their body

392
00:27:16,770 --> 00:27:18,840
gradually turned into that of a Saming.

393
00:27:24,270 --> 00:27:25,980
Weretiger...

394
00:27:28,950 --> 00:27:31,980
The glyphs that were worked
onto Krating's body

395
00:27:33,150 --> 00:27:35,800
are my elder brother's.

396
00:27:37,980 --> 00:27:39,600
My elder brother

397
00:27:39,980 --> 00:27:42,430
yearned to claim the family's tiger.

398
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:44,880
Legend has it that

399
00:27:45,650 --> 00:27:47,980
whoever possesses the family's tiger

400
00:27:48,890 --> 00:27:51,750
shall become
the mightiest sorcerer of all.

401
00:27:53,980 --> 00:27:54,990
So...

402
00:27:56,850 --> 00:27:59,240
this family's tiger...

403
00:27:59,670 --> 00:28:00,800
where is it now?

404
00:28:10,110 --> 00:28:11,980
It is no one's responsibility but mine.

405
00:28:31,770 --> 00:28:33,640
It must have been so painful,

406
00:28:34,430 --> 00:28:37,200
having carried so much on your shoulders.

407
00:28:41,980 --> 00:28:43,600
Don't worry, though.

408
00:28:45,290 --> 00:28:47,210
From now on,

409
00:28:49,850 --> 00:28:51,840
this dearest of yours
will help ease your burden.

410
00:28:54,590 --> 00:28:56,590
I'll hold your hand

411
00:28:56,850 --> 00:28:57,710
and...

412
00:28:57,850 --> 00:28:59,980
stay by your side like this, always.

413
00:29:39,750 --> 00:29:41,000
My dearest, follow me.

414
00:29:50,120 --> 00:29:51,010
Mother...

415
00:29:55,850 --> 00:29:56,840
Hello.

416
00:30:03,320 --> 00:30:05,690
You are shielded by the charm of metta,

417
00:30:06,110 --> 00:30:07,400
which is hard to come by.

418
00:30:08,750 --> 00:30:10,830
It is indeed
what your father proclaimed.

419
00:30:13,980 --> 00:30:16,430
He said that my beautiful daughter Bulan

420
00:30:16,430 --> 00:30:17,550
shall meet a lover

421
00:30:18,750 --> 00:30:20,160
whose appearance

422
00:30:20,320 --> 00:30:21,980
is in this very manner,

423
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:24,250
and that if I do not believe it,

424
00:30:25,520 --> 00:30:27,440
I shall linger to see with my own eyes,

425
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:29,490
so I would know he spoke no lies.

426
00:30:30,490 --> 00:30:31,670
This day,

427
00:30:31,980 --> 00:30:34,290
I have finally witnessed
the truth in his words.

428
00:30:39,690 --> 00:30:41,980
I suppose you did not merely
bring her here to introduce her to me.

429
00:30:42,670 --> 00:30:44,480
What is the reason

430
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:45,980
you two paid me a visit?

431
00:30:48,990 --> 00:30:50,990
Treasure your hearts well,

432
00:30:51,320 --> 00:30:52,640
for when the time comes,

433
00:30:53,320 --> 00:30:55,730
I shall reap them from both your chests.

434
00:31:01,330 --> 00:31:02,990
He came for me at home,

435
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:05,730
proclaiming that he would maim my heart.

436
00:31:08,630 --> 00:31:11,000
He wounded you once afore.

437
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,760
I fear he would do it to you again.

438
00:31:19,750 --> 00:31:21,210
Worry not about me.

439
00:31:21,980 --> 00:31:24,450
I dwell under the protection of
the Triple Gem of Buddhism.

440
00:31:25,870 --> 00:31:27,280
No profane arts

441
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,880
could harm me.

442
00:31:35,530 --> 00:31:37,160
My beautiful daughter,

443
00:31:38,130 --> 00:31:39,430
are you angry at me

444
00:31:40,190 --> 00:31:41,830
for not raising him well,

445
00:31:42,810 --> 00:31:44,440
for not instilling in him

446
00:31:44,670 --> 00:31:46,990
the difference between good and bad?

447
00:31:48,160 --> 00:31:50,350
Thus, he chose
the wrong path to walk upon.

448
00:31:52,490 --> 00:31:53,240
Mother,

449
00:31:53,730 --> 00:31:55,310
blame yourself not.

450
00:31:55,730 --> 00:31:57,030
This matter is subjective,

451
00:31:57,520 --> 00:31:59,210
hinging on nature.

452
00:31:59,560 --> 00:32:01,000
I too was raised by you,

453
00:32:01,870 --> 00:32:05,530
yet I do not mistake a chakram for a lotus.

454
00:32:08,690 --> 00:32:10,810
I shall leave her in your care.

455
00:32:11,690 --> 00:32:13,250
In time to come,

456
00:32:13,980 --> 00:32:15,710
even though there lie obstacles,

457
00:32:17,330 --> 00:32:19,980
pray you, do not let go
of each other's hands.

458
00:32:21,800 --> 00:32:22,520
Of course.

459
00:32:23,560 --> 00:32:25,770
No matter what happens in the future,

460
00:32:26,170 --> 00:32:27,840
I promise that...

461
00:32:28,810 --> 00:32:30,680
I will hold on to Master Bulan's hands

462
00:32:33,450 --> 00:32:34,650
without letting go.

463
00:32:40,830 --> 00:32:42,480
What say you, dear Bulan?

464
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:51,030
The days are yet to come.

465
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:54,400
I do not wish to break my word,

466
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:57,190
for I know not

467
00:32:57,840 --> 00:33:00,240
if the days to come
shall prove to be as I fathom.

468
00:33:02,190 --> 00:33:03,980
Spirits and earthly bodies

469
00:33:04,750 --> 00:33:06,440
are bound to part when the time comes.

470
00:33:08,710 --> 00:33:10,170
You know well

471
00:33:10,910 --> 00:33:12,590
that when the time comes to forsake,

472
00:33:13,450 --> 00:33:14,790
you ought to do so.

473
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,760
I do not wish to answer questions

474
00:33:18,760 --> 00:33:20,320
regarding matters that are yet to come.

475
00:33:23,110 --> 00:33:24,310
Know you...

476
00:33:25,320 --> 00:33:26,800
how deeply I love her?

477
00:33:28,250 --> 00:33:29,980
Should I lose her,

478
00:33:31,980 --> 00:33:33,550
I do not suppose I could live.

479
00:34:00,710 --> 00:34:02,360
It's okay

480
00:34:03,010 --> 00:34:05,360
if you don't want
to be hand in hand with me

481
00:34:05,650 --> 00:34:06,810
when that day comes.

482
00:34:09,010 --> 00:34:10,630
But I want you to know that...

483
00:34:11,590 --> 00:34:13,980
I will always be by your side like this

484
00:34:14,780 --> 00:34:17,430
no matter what comes our way,

485
00:34:17,460 --> 00:34:17,990
or...

486
00:34:18,490 --> 00:34:21,290
no matter how much things change.

487
00:34:23,280 --> 00:34:24,440
I'm confident that

488
00:34:27,110 --> 00:34:28,370
I will...

489
00:34:28,370 --> 00:34:30,920
hold your hand like this forever,
as your dearest.

490
00:34:41,980 --> 00:34:44,320
[Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

491
00:34:44,320 --> 00:34:45,760
Last week,

492
00:34:45,760 --> 00:34:47,050
the police

493
00:34:47,050 --> 00:34:49,080
arrested Krating,

494
00:34:49,080 --> 00:34:51,470
along with all the accomplices
in the human-trafficking syndicate,

495
00:34:51,470 --> 00:34:53,030
bringing the total to 13 individuals.

496
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:55,090
This operation

497
00:34:55,090 --> 00:34:57,530
is a joint effort by Mae Sot Police Station,

498
00:34:57,530 --> 00:34:58,750
Phop Phra Police Station,

499
00:34:58,750 --> 00:34:59,980
and other relevant authorities.

500
00:34:59,980 --> 00:35:00,710
Sir,

501
00:35:00,710 --> 00:35:03,400
there's been a rumor circulating
about how the suspect in custody

502
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:04,920
mysteriously passed away
at the police station.

503
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:05,720
Is it true?

504
00:35:06,400 --> 00:35:07,360
What do you say, sir?

505
00:35:07,980 --> 00:35:08,760
Yes.

506
00:35:09,400 --> 00:35:11,980
All the suspects in this case
have passed away.

507
00:35:11,980 --> 00:35:13,410
What are their causes of death?

508
00:35:13,410 --> 00:35:15,510
Is this a murder to cover up the truth?

509
00:35:15,510 --> 00:35:17,000
- Is there anyone behind it?
- Is it true that someone's behind this?

510
00:35:17,010 --> 00:35:17,980
Please answer the questions.

511
00:35:17,980 --> 00:35:19,480
Please answer the questions.

512
00:35:19,480 --> 00:35:20,630
Right now,

513
00:35:20,630 --> 00:35:23,090
the police are gathering evidence,

514
00:35:23,090 --> 00:35:23,980
and everything in the case file

515
00:35:23,980 --> 00:35:26,160
cannot be disclosed to the public yet.

516
00:35:26,330 --> 00:35:26,960
But, sir,

517
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:27,980
the people want answers.

518
00:35:27,980 --> 00:35:28,950
Please answer some of them.

519
00:35:28,950 --> 00:35:30,450
Could you provide more clarification?

520
00:35:32,690 --> 00:35:33,830
Right now,

521
00:35:33,830 --> 00:35:35,290
please allow some time for the police

522
00:35:35,290 --> 00:35:36,570
to work on the case.

523
00:35:39,980 --> 00:35:42,490
You said the person behind all this

524
00:35:42,650 --> 00:35:44,240
is a master sorcerer.

525
00:35:44,630 --> 00:35:46,670
How are we gonna proceed now?

526
00:35:51,980 --> 00:35:54,390
[Mom]

527
00:36:04,280 --> 00:36:05,330
Hello.

528
00:36:06,990 --> 00:36:08,240
Of course, absolutely.

529
00:36:09,550 --> 00:36:10,450
Right away.

530
00:36:11,630 --> 00:36:12,450
Lieutenant Peem,

531
00:36:14,640 --> 00:36:15,450
this is for you.

532
00:36:33,710 --> 00:36:34,840
Hello.

533
00:36:35,490 --> 00:36:36,240
Peem,

534
00:36:36,720 --> 00:36:38,730
how dare you lie to me?

535
00:36:40,010 --> 00:36:41,160
Mom...

536
00:36:41,550 --> 00:36:44,390
Why did you call
the superintendent's number?

537
00:36:44,720 --> 00:36:46,270
Don't change the subject on me, Peem.

538
00:36:46,570 --> 00:36:47,980
Come home at once.

539
00:36:48,170 --> 00:36:50,210
Don't force me to come for you myself,

540
00:36:50,410 --> 00:36:52,240
or someone will be in trouble.

541
00:37:01,980 --> 00:37:03,290
Okay, Mom.

542
00:37:04,570 --> 00:37:06,290
I'll be right there.

543
00:38:05,680 --> 00:38:07,510
So...

544
00:38:09,870 --> 00:38:11,610
Breathe your words.

545
00:38:11,610 --> 00:38:13,370
Do not hem and haw.

546
00:38:13,760 --> 00:38:15,120
I shall not chide you.

547
00:38:17,010 --> 00:38:18,130
Jeez...

548
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:18,910
Hey...

549
00:38:19,080 --> 00:38:20,680
speaking in that stern voice,

550
00:38:21,120 --> 00:38:23,050
and you're still not chiding me?

551
00:38:24,440 --> 00:38:25,480
Should you not say a word,

552
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:27,250
I shall seek my bed.

553
00:38:27,830 --> 00:38:28,550
Huh...

554
00:38:28,550 --> 00:38:29,650
You're getting sulky like a child.

555
00:38:29,980 --> 00:38:31,270
Fine,

556
00:38:31,490 --> 00:38:32,430
I'll tell you now.

557
00:38:33,730 --> 00:38:35,980
So...

558
00:38:36,990 --> 00:38:37,490
Uh.

559
00:38:37,850 --> 00:38:38,890
- Ow...
- You are dragging on.

560
00:38:41,670 --> 00:38:42,710
So...

561
00:38:43,410 --> 00:38:45,010
Earlier...

562
00:38:45,690 --> 00:38:48,400
you introduced me to...

563
00:38:48,870 --> 00:38:49,980
Vulnerable Mother,

564
00:38:50,330 --> 00:38:51,810
a nun who is...

565
00:38:52,710 --> 00:38:54,270
your mother, right, my beloved?

566
00:38:55,980 --> 00:38:56,650
Mm.

567
00:38:56,920 --> 00:38:57,980
And?

568
00:38:59,640 --> 00:39:00,980
And...

569
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:04,990
I just feel like...

570
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:07,980
I want to introduce you...

571
00:39:08,370 --> 00:39:10,630
to my own family.

572
00:39:12,870 --> 00:39:14,320
You are bidding me

573
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:17,590
to travel to your home in Bangkok,

574
00:39:17,590 --> 00:39:18,450
are you not?

575
00:39:22,800 --> 00:39:23,570
Mm.

576
00:39:27,980 --> 00:39:29,330
Do you want to?

577
00:39:34,290 --> 00:39:36,800
You need to speak of
what is clouding your mind,

578
00:39:36,800 --> 00:39:37,980
and I shall answer.

579
00:39:46,430 --> 00:39:47,560
So...

580
00:39:49,750 --> 00:39:50,600
I...

581
00:39:51,130 --> 00:39:53,290
haven't told my mother from the start

582
00:39:53,290 --> 00:39:55,980
that the reason I transferred here...

583
00:39:56,250 --> 00:39:57,800
was to investigate...

584
00:39:58,210 --> 00:39:59,770
Krating's clues

585
00:40:00,330 --> 00:40:01,210
and...

586
00:40:03,850 --> 00:40:05,800
to win you over

587
00:40:06,520 --> 00:40:09,520
after you refused to make
consecrated bullets for me in the beginning.

588
00:40:12,230 --> 00:40:14,240
You are saying

589
00:40:14,510 --> 00:40:16,160
that I too am at fault;

590
00:40:16,490 --> 00:40:18,710
thus, you wish me to shoulder
the weight of karma with you,

591
00:40:18,910 --> 00:40:19,690
are you not?

592
00:40:20,650 --> 00:40:21,650
That's not what I'm saying.

593
00:40:22,330 --> 00:40:23,770
What you just said...

594
00:40:23,770 --> 00:40:25,010
I never said

595
00:40:25,010 --> 00:40:27,000
it was your fault.

596
00:40:27,530 --> 00:40:29,510
It's actually my fault.

597
00:40:29,510 --> 00:40:31,240
You can punish me however you want.

598
00:40:31,240 --> 00:40:32,450
I'll take it all.

599
00:40:33,410 --> 00:40:33,980
Here.

600
00:40:33,980 --> 00:40:34,890
My beloved...hit me...

601
00:40:34,890 --> 00:40:35,370
Ow.

602
00:40:35,980 --> 00:40:36,470
Ow...

603
00:40:36,470 --> 00:40:36,990
Ouch!

604
00:40:37,760 --> 00:40:38,830
Hit me again.

605
00:40:39,030 --> 00:40:39,980
Mm...

606
00:40:41,250 --> 00:40:42,410
Why did you stop?

607
00:41:01,080 --> 00:41:02,950
I shall travel to Bangkok with you.

608
00:41:04,970 --> 00:41:05,770
Really?

609
00:41:07,730 --> 00:41:08,990
You mean it?

610
00:41:13,430 --> 00:41:14,800
I never weave a lie.

611
00:41:23,320 --> 00:41:24,600
Thank you, my beloved.

612
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:27,010
My beloved,

613
00:41:27,560 --> 00:41:28,960
you know...

614
00:41:29,790 --> 00:41:31,600
my mother

615
00:41:31,980 --> 00:41:33,980
is very kind,

616
00:41:34,430 --> 00:41:36,360
and I do believe

617
00:41:36,360 --> 00:41:37,520
that when...

618
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:40,280
she meets you,

619
00:41:41,010 --> 00:41:42,570
she's gonna like you

620
00:41:42,890 --> 00:41:43,980
as much...

621
00:41:45,240 --> 00:41:47,190
as I do.

622
00:41:49,980 --> 00:41:51,510
I too wish so.

623
00:42:11,370 --> 00:42:14,710
[Bangkok]

624
00:42:33,410 --> 00:42:34,670
Hello, Miss Peem.

625
00:42:35,190 --> 00:42:36,570
- Hello, Uncle.
- Hello.

626
00:42:36,910 --> 00:42:37,980
How have you been?

627
00:42:38,370 --> 00:42:39,440
I've been fine.

628
00:42:44,730 --> 00:42:45,650
Uncle,

629
00:42:46,200 --> 00:42:46,930
this...

630
00:42:47,390 --> 00:42:47,980
is Bulan,

631
00:42:48,390 --> 00:42:49,450
my girlfriend.

632
00:42:51,040 --> 00:42:51,630
Huh?

633
00:42:52,530 --> 00:42:53,200
Girlfriend?

634
00:42:54,360 --> 00:42:56,150
You have a girlfriend, Miss Peem?

635
00:42:57,400 --> 00:42:58,530
What is it, Sorn?

636
00:42:59,160 --> 00:43:00,610
Who is whose girlfriend?

637
00:43:01,230 --> 00:43:01,980
Auntie Thip...

638
00:43:07,840 --> 00:43:08,490
There...

639
00:43:08,680 --> 00:43:09,720
So, where...

640
00:43:09,980 --> 00:43:11,160
is this girlfriend of yours, Miss Peem?

641
00:43:11,320 --> 00:43:13,350
Let me take a look at her face.

642
00:43:14,550 --> 00:43:15,850
Healthy skin,

643
00:43:15,850 --> 00:43:17,400
a beautiful face,

644
00:43:17,980 --> 00:43:18,600
and a nice chest...

645
00:43:18,600 --> 00:43:19,870
waist, and hips...

646
00:43:21,980 --> 00:43:23,830
You made a good choice
for yourself, Miss Peem.

647
00:43:26,470 --> 00:43:27,980
Let's go inside.

648
00:43:28,630 --> 00:43:30,720
Your mother is waiting.

649
00:43:30,720 --> 00:43:31,510
Sure thing.

650
00:43:31,510 --> 00:43:32,640
Please take care of it, Uncle Sorn.

651
00:43:32,640 --> 00:43:33,530
Of course, Miss Peem.

652
00:43:33,530 --> 00:43:34,360
Please.

653
00:44:16,810 --> 00:44:17,960
Miss Peem,

654
00:44:18,710 --> 00:44:19,980
lately, Mrs. Ratchapee

655
00:44:20,330 --> 00:44:21,980
has been acting strange.

656
00:44:22,640 --> 00:44:23,650
It is as though...

657
00:44:23,980 --> 00:44:25,120
she's sick.

658
00:44:31,160 --> 00:44:31,980
My beloved.

659
00:44:46,760 --> 00:44:47,980
Peem.

660
00:44:51,230 --> 00:44:52,440
You're home, my dear?

661
00:44:55,870 --> 00:44:56,870
Yes, Mom.

662
00:44:56,990 --> 00:44:57,980
I'm home.

663
00:45:37,050 --> 00:45:38,480
Aren't you a guest?

664
00:45:38,890 --> 00:45:41,010
You have no right to roam about

665
00:45:41,210 --> 00:45:43,630
without the homeowner's permission.

666
00:45:50,470 --> 00:45:52,570
Get out of my daughter's life.

667
00:45:52,570 --> 00:45:53,980
That way, I can be sure

668
00:45:54,250 --> 00:45:57,430
you won't cast
any foul magic on my daughter.

669
00:45:57,650 --> 00:46:00,430
That we have met means
destiny has led us to cross paths.

670
00:46:00,800 --> 00:46:03,520
But if this is as far as
our past merit takes us,

671
00:46:03,520 --> 00:46:05,010
then so be it.

672
00:46:21,560 --> 00:46:24,990
♫It's not that I don't feel it♫

673
00:46:24,990 --> 00:46:28,790
